---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
---
<Layout title="Apon Campus Ambassador Recruitment Program – Apon UK" description="Apon Pioneers 1.0">
  <PageHeader title="Apon Pioneers 1.0" subtitle="" />
  <section class="section white"><article class="container prose">
    <p>Apon Pioneers 1.0 is the official Campus Ambassador Recruitment Program of Apon.uk, a global career platform dedicated to study abroad with scholarship and funding opportunities, freelancing, startup development, Research Degree and Job Overseas.<br/>We believe student ambassadors play a vital role in bridging the gap between campuses and our mission. As Apon Pioneers, you will help us reach our goals while building valuable skills and networks for yourself.</p>
    <section><h2>Eligibility</h2><ul><li>Open to students from any college or university.</li><li>Must be currently enrolled in HSC, Honours, Alim, or A-Levels.</li><li>Commitment: 4 months.</li><li>Involvement with any clubs or organizations</li><li>Weekly 10-14 hours of Work</li></ul></section>
    <section><h2>Responsibilities of Apon Pioneers</h2><ul><li>Promote Apon.uk activities within their campus.</li><li>Serve as the bridge between your institution (students, faculty and clubs) and Apon.uk.</li><li>Share branding materials (posters, leaflets, digital content) across their campus.</li><li>Help in making MoU‘s with clubs and organization in your own campus</li></ul></section>
    <section><h2>Benefits for Apon Pioneers</h2><ul><li>Completion certificate recognizing your contribution.</li><li>Paid internships opportunities to our different departments such as IT, Business, when vacancies are available</li><li>Free access to all premium courses offered by Apon.uk.</li><li>A chance to expand professional network and develop leadership skills.</li><li>Commission on each referral to our paid workshops, sessions</li><li>Guidance and mentorship session from the experienced faculty, professionals etc</li></ul></section>
    <section><h2>Performance Evaluation</h2><p>Submission of a monthly activity report detailing completed tasks.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Registration is Open Now</h2><p>Registration form link: <a href="https://forms.gle/tiFAfowZx3XGzU7S6">https://forms.gle/tiFAfowZx3XGzU7S6</a></p></section>
    <section><h2>Deadline of Registration</h2><p>October 10, 2025</p></section>
    <section><h2>For Further Queries</h2><p>Reach us at: info@apon.uk</p></section>
  </article></section>
</Layout>
